## Attribution: the Stream model

This software is derived from Stream, an event-based mesoscopic
implementation of the LWR kinematic wave model, distributed under the
CeCILL-B free software license (https://cecill.info/licences/Licence_CeCILL-B_V1-en.html).

Stream authors: Cerema Centre-Est, Aurélien Clairais, Etienne Hans, Aurélien Duret
Stream location: https://gitlab.cerema.fr/centre-est/mobilite/Stream/stream-python

The single-stream core of this engine (one pipe per link) is a port of the
Stream model and reproduces it; the pipe partition, class permissions,
movement restrictions, friction coupling, dynamic patches and the
verification apparatus are new in this work.

In accordance with the CeCILL-B license, any redistribution of this software
or of software derived from it must keep this notice, including the
reference to the Stream authors and the location of Stream.

